 know Amazon&#x27;s suspension reasons, what they&#x27;ll accept in appeals, and how to escalate when first appeals fail. Termination is harder to reverse, but we&#x27;ve helped sellers recover terminated accounts through strategic escalation. $3,500 flat fee. 7–14 day turnaround. Transparent process.</p></div></section><section class="py-16 bg-neutral-50 bg-shades"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-6xl"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="text-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><p class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#6172F3] mb-2">200+</p><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">Accounts Reinstated</p></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><p class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#6172F3] mb-2">$1.7B</p><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">Sales Restored</p></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><p class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#6172F3] mb-2">7-14 Days</p><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900">Average Turnaround</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-shades"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-3xl"><div style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 font-satoshi mb-8">Our Reinstatement Process</h2><div class="space-y-6"><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border border-neutral-200" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">1. Initial Consultation</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">You tell us what happened. We ask clarifying questions about the suspension notice and your account history.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border border-neutral-200" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">2. Root Cause Investigation</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">We dig into your account data: sales metrics, customer feedback, product catalog, pricing patterns.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border border-neutral-200" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">3. Plan of Action Development</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">We draft your Plan of Action. It includes accountability, root cause analysis, and corrective steps.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border border-neutral-200" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">4. Appeal Submission</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">We submit your appeal to Amazon. Then we wait for their response (typically 5-10 business days).</p></div><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border border-neutral-200" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">5. Escalation Strategy</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">If rejected, we escalate via attorney contact, Account Management channels, or other pressure points.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg border border-neutral-200" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 mb-2 font-satoshi">6. Reinstatement &amp; Prevention</h3><p class="text-neutral-600">Once reinstated, we work with you on preventing future suspensions.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-neutral-50 bg-shades"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-3xl"><div class="bg-[#6172F3]/5 border border-[#6172F3] rounded-lg p-8 mb-8" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4 font-satoshi">Pricing &amp; What&#x27;s Included</h2><p class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#6172F3] mb-6">$3,500 Flat Fee</p><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-